  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Programme Officer International Organization for Migration (IOM) Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme Officer will assume responsibility and be held accountable for coordinating the activities of the MHPSS Technical Working Group (TWG) at the country level. This role will involve liaising with relevant clusters, MHPSS actors, governments, donors, universities, and relevant international bodies. The Programme Officer will work under the direct supervision of the Programme Manager MHPSS and Protection and overall supervision of the Head of the Migration Management Unit.</narrative>
  </description>
